333 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 83 0 R/E(GLP-1 medications work by mimicking or enhancing the effects of this hormone to improve appetite and glucose control. However, the body naturally produces GLP-1, and its release can be influenced by dietary and lifestyle habits. A food-first approach focuses on strengthening this natural response in a sustainable way.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

