347 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 84 0 R/E(The gut microbiome plays a role in GLP-1 regulation. Fermented foods help support microbial diversity and gut health. A balanced microbiome may enhance natural appetite signaling.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

