<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 105 0 R/Pg 40 0 R/A[1936 0 R 0]/K[17]>>
endobj

1305 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 105 0 R/Pg 40 0 R/A[1543 0 R 0]/K[18]>>
endobj

